This is a personal portfolio project built with Next.js App Router, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, shadcn/ui, Zustand, Jest, and React Testing Library.

Use English for:

- code
- variables
- functions
- components
- file names
- folders
- comments
- commit messages

Keep the code simple, clean, and maintainable.

Use reusable components.

Prefer functional React components and hooks.

Follow modern Next.js App Router and TypeScript best practices.

Prefer composition over complex abstractions.

Avoid over-engineering.

Do not modify many files at once unless necessary.

Before large changes, explain the plan first.

Keep folder structure organized and scalable.

Prefer responsive and accessible UI.
